          "pseudo": "A new temple was to be built upon the old foundations, its blueprint drawn by a modern master. He chose a maiden from across the great water to wear the crown of the fated queen. This act, destined to stir the furies, unleashed a storm of voices in the ether—the defenders of the shrine and the bearers of the new flame. The debate was not of casting, but of whose hands might hold the sacred texts, and whose eyes might claim the right to look upon the ancient face.",
